### Signing in user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"john@example.com",
    "password":"securepassword123"
}

### Getting the current
GET http://localhost:8000/api/get-current-user

### generating token pairs
POST http://localhost:8000/api/refresh-token

### change password
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "oldPassword": "securepassword123",
    "newPassword": "asdfghjkl"
}

### Update User Avatar
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/update-avatar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebKitFormBoundaryAvatarUpdate

