### deleting a video
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/delete-video/6ac99dac2e2001e224964e00

### get a video
GET http://localhost:8000/api/find-video/6ac9bd897886c67692a126ac

### get all videos from this user
GET http://localhost:8000/api/all-videos/6ab3718a209a1e7de3b38abb

### increasing view count (watching a video)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/increase-view-count/6ac9b29229ad956afe4204c3

### updating video status
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/update-video-status/6ac9b29229ad956afe4204c3

### deleting all videos that belong to this user
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/delete-all-videos/6ab3718a209a1e7de3b38abb

### creating a tweet
POST http://localhost:8000/api/create-tweet/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "Code. Test. Ship. Repeat. ⚡"
}

### get this user tweet
GET http://localhost:8000/api/tweets/6ab3718a209a1e7de3b38abb

### updating the tweet
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/tweet/u/6ac9bca07886c67692a126ab
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content":"Do not give up"
}

### deleting the tweet
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/tweet/d/6ac9b691b03b2b42e3a9e7ff

### adding comment to a video
POST http://localhost:8000/api/video/6ac9bd897886c67692a126ac/add-comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content":"Dummy comment for testing"
}

### updating a coment
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/update-comment/6ac9c9e33e20944cb7cdf5dd
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content":"Updated dummy comment"
}

### deleting a comment
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/delete-comment/6ac9c9e33e20944cb7cdf5dd

### subscribing to a channel
POST http://localhost:8000/api/subscription/6ab3718a209a1e7de3b38abb

### getting subscribers
GET http://localhost:8000/api/subscriptions/6ab3718a209a1e7de3b38abb/subscribers

### getting subcribed channels
GET http://localhost:8000/api/subscriptions/6ab3718a209a1e7de3b38abb/channels

### Seeing user dashboard
GET http://localhost:8000/api/channel/dashboard/6ab3718a209a1e7de3b38abb

### Deleting the user (Destructive! This will delete the videos, tweets, comments, likes and everything made by the user and then delete the user itself)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/delete-account/6ab3718a209a1e7de3b38abb